  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards in Indonesia Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Awards scholarships program in Indonesia provides scholarships to Indonesians for study, research and professional development in Australia. The program offers a range of long-term and short-term scholarships modalities, as well as activities to support scholars before, during and after their study in Australia. The program contributes to human capital development in Indonesia, with diverse alumni using their skills, knowledge and networks to contribute to Indonesia&apos;s inclusive and sustainable development. The program strengthens bilateral ties through people-to-people connections, with diverse alumni contributing to cooperation between Australia and Indonesia. Study areas are closely aligned with Indonesian Government development objectives and priority areas of bilateral engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
